{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And the slope of the streams.</b> The outflow of the streams, like אשדות הפסגה." "<b>Which slopes toward the settlement of Ar.</b> That is, it sloped through their territory, and the settlement of Ar is Moab, as it is written: והמואבים היושבים בער. And they were already dwelling on both sides of the streams, and now the stream leaned toward the border of Moab, for their border did not cross the stream."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:09:43.731916684Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}